        <header class="brand"><div><div class="brand-mark"><span class="mark">E</span> EasyBiz ERP</div><p class="eyebrow" style="margin-top:.65rem">Official Monthly Store Statement</p><h1>Maria's Store – Davao City</h1><p class="muted">Stall 14-B, Agdao Public Market, Davao City, 8000 Davao del Sur<br>TIN: 420-918-332-000 · Mobile: +63 917 892 4510</p></div><div class="doc-meta"><p class="eyebrow">Report Coverage</p><strong>September 1 – 30, 2026</strong><p class="muted" style="margin-top:.7rem"><b>Doc No:</b> RPT-2026-09-M<br><b>Printed:</b> Sep 30, 2026 · 6:15 PM</p></div></header>
        <section class="section"><div class="section-title">1. Month-at-a-Glance Cash Flow</div><div class="metrics"><div class="metric"><span class="label">Total Sales (Cash In)</span><div class="value">₱428,750.00</div><span class="note">From 1,248 daily counter transactions</span></div><div class="metric"><span class="label">Cost of Goods Purchased</span><div class="value">₱244,500.00</div><span class="note">Paid to beverage &amp; food distributors</span></div><div class="metric"><span class="label">Store Net Earnings</span><div class="value positive">₱98,420.00</div><span class="note">After supplier cost, utilities &amp; crew</span></div></div></section>
        <section class="section"><div class="section-title">2. Income &amp; Expense Reconciliation</div><table><thead><tr><th>Line Item / Category</th><th>Description / Notes</th><th class="amount">Amount (PHP)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><b>Gross Counter Sales</b></td><td class="muted">Retail sales (cash in drawer + QR Ph / GCash)</td><td class="amount positive">+₱428,750.00</td></tr><tr><td><b>Inventory Restock (Purchases)</b></td><td class="muted">Stock orders from URC, San Miguel, Mega Global, Alaska</td><td class="amount negative">-₱244,500.00</td></tr><tr><td><b>Store Staff Wages (2 helpers)</b></td><td class="muted">Semi-monthly bi-weekly payouts (Sep 15 &amp; Sep 30)</td><td class="amount negative">-₱32,000.00</td></tr><tr><td><b>Store Stall Rent &amp; Electric Bill</b></td><td class="muted">Market stall lease + chiller power</td><td class="amount negative">-₱33,830.00</td></tr><tr><td><b>Reimbursements &amp; Minor Supplies</b></td><td class="muted">Ice delivery, plastic bags, receipt rolls</td><td class="amount negative">-₱20,000.00</td></tr><tr><td colspan="2"><b>Net Store Income for September</b><br><span class="muted">Clean cash retained for Maria's personal savings</span></td><td class="amount positive"><b>₱98,420.00</b></td></tr></tbody></table></section>
        <section class="section"><div class="section-title">3. Top 5 Best-Selling Items</div><div class="two-col"><div class="rank-list">@foreach ([['San Miguel Pale Pilsen 330ml','1,420 bottles sold','₱71,000.00'],['Lucky Me! Pancit Canton (Calamansi)','890 packs sold','₱16,020.00'],['Mega Sardines in Tomato Sauce 155g','510 cans sold','₱12,750.00'],['Bear Brand Powdered Milk 33g','640 sachets sold','₱10,240.00'],['Great Taste White Coffee Twin Pack','580 packs sold','₱8,700.00']] as $item)<div class="rank"><div><span class="rank-name">{{ $loop->iteration }}. {{ $item[0] }}</span><br><span class="rank-detail">{{ $item[1] }}</span></div><span class="rank-value">{{ $item[2] }}</span></div>@endforeach</div><div><div class="section-title" style="margin-top:0">4. Weekly Sales Pattern</div><p class="muted">Average customer intake and peak revenue days:</p><div class="week-list"><div class="week"><b>Saturday (Peak Day ⭐)</b><span class="rank-value">₱24,200 / day</span></div><div class="week"><b>Sunday</b><span class="rank-value">₱19,800 / day</span></div><div class="week"><b>Friday Payday</b><span class="rank-value">₱18,500 / day</span></div><div class="week"><b>Mon–Thu Average</b><span class="rank-value">₱11,200 / day</span></div></div><div class="recommendation"><b>Recommendation:</b> Prepare extra fast-moving stock every Friday for the Saturday peak.</div></div></div></section>
